{"id":909959,"title":"04｜通用工具封装协议：带你快速上手 MCP","content":"MCP 是 AI 时代的 API 标准协议，旨在解决 Agent 与工具间的紧耦合问题，实现两者的独立开发与灵活调用。其架构由三部分组成：MCP Server 负责封装工具、提示词库及只读资源；MCP Client 提供列出工具（list_tools）和调用工具（call_tool）的标准接口；MCP Host 则整合 Agent 与 Client，让用户通过自然语言驱动任务执行。\n\nMCP 支持三种通信传输方式：STDIO 适用于本地测试，需随客户端启动；SSE 为轻量级单向推送协议；Streamable HTTP 支持双向流式通信，最适配 AI 对话场景。此外，MCP 不仅封装执行工具，还纳入了预设提示词模板和只读资源管理能力，增强了交互的丰富性与安全性。\n\n在开发实践上，利用 Python MCP SDK 可快速构建 Server。通过引入 FastMCP 类并使用 @mcp.tool 装饰器，即可将普通函数转化为标准工具，配合文档字符串自动生成工具描述。Server 可配置为 Streamable HTTP 或 SSE 模式运行，支持自定义监听地址与端口。Client 端只需建立对应协议的 Session，传入 Server 地址，即可按标准流程发现并调用远程工具。该机制大幅降低了 AI 应用集成的复杂度，推动了工具生态的标准化与复用。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402620,"user_name":"药师","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1213258,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"14BB054A38A2F0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/83/4a/3e08427e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1758704560,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146360,"content":"是的","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1758858675,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":402620,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"老师sse也支持流式响应消息呢","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":672029,"discussion_content":"是的","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1758858675,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":402603